{"seq":3,"slug":"serialization","title":"序列化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/idioms-and-best-practices/serialization","wordCount":616,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"序列化\">序列化</h1><p>kotlinx.serialization 是 Kotlin 官方的多平台序列化框架，通过编译器插件在编译时生成序列化代码，提供类型安全、高性能的序列化体验。支持 JSON、Protobuf、CBOR 等多种格式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>kotlinx.serialization 的核心是<strong>编译期生成序列化代码</strong>：序列化器由编译器插件在编译时产出，而非运行时反射，因而类型安全、性能更好且天然支持多平台。基于此，<code>Json</code> 配置、注解、多态序列化与自定义序列化器构成了控制序列化行为的全部旋钮。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基础用法\">基础用法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlinx.serialization.*&#10;import kotlinx.serialization.json.*&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class User(&#10;    val id: Long,&#10;    val name: String,&#10;    val email: String&#10;)&#10;&#10;val json = Json { prettyPrint = true }&#10;&#10;// 序列化&#10;val jsonString = json.encodeToString(User(1, &quot;张三&quot;, &quot;zhangsan@example.com&quot;))&#10;&#10;// 反序列化&#10;val user = json.decodeFromString&lt;User&gt;(jsonString)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.serialization.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.serialization.json.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class User(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val id: Long,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val email: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val json = Json { prettyPrint = true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 序列化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val jsonString = json.encodeToString(User(1, \"张三\", \"zhangsan@example.com\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 反序列化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val user = json.decodeFromString&#x3C;User>(jsonString)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Kotlin 对象] --&gt;|encodeToString| B[JSON 字符串]&#10;    B --&gt;|decodeFromString| A&#10;    C[&quot;@Serializable&quot;] --&gt;|编译器插件| D[自动生成序列化器]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Kotlin 对象] --&gt;|encodeToString| B[JSON 字符串]\n    B --&gt;|decodeFromString| A\n    C[\"@Serializable\"] --&gt;|编译器插件| D[自动生成序列化器]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"json-配置\">Json 配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val json = Json {&#10;    prettyPrint = true              // 格式化输出&#10;    isLenient = true                // 宽松解析&#10;    ignoreUnknownKeys = true        // 忽略未知字段&#10;    coerceInputValues = true        // 类型不匹配时使用默认值&#10;    encodeDefaults = true           // 编码默认值&#10;    explicitNulls = false           // 不输出 null 字段&#10;    namingStrategy = JsonNamingStrategy.SnakeCase // 蛇形命名&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val json = Json {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prettyPrint = true              // 格式化输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    isLenient = true                // 宽松解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ignoreUnknownKeys = true        // 忽略未知字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    coerceInputValues = true        // 类型不匹配时使用默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    encodeDefaults = true           // 编码默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    explicitNulls = false           // 不输出 null 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    namingStrategy = JsonNamingStrategy.SnakeCase // 蛇形命名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ignoreUnknownKeys</code></td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>遇到未知字段是否忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isLenient</code></td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>是否接受非标准 JSON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>encodeDefaults</code></td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>是否序列化有默认值的字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>explicitNulls</code></td>\n<td>true</td>\n<td>是否输出值为 null 的字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>coerceInputValues</code></td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>类型不匹配时使用默认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prettyPrint</code></td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>是否格式化输出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"注解\">注解</h2><h3 id=\"serialname\">@SerialName</h3><p>自定义 JSON 字段名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Serializable&#10;data class ApiResponse(&#10;    @SerialName(&quot;status_code&quot;)&#10;    val statusCode: Int,&#10;    @SerialName(&quot;error_message&quot;)&#10;    val errorMessage: String? = null,&#10;    @SerialName(&quot;data&quot;)&#10;    val payload: List&lt;Item&gt; = emptyList()&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ApiResponse(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @SerialName(\"status_code\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val statusCode: Int,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @SerialName(\"error_message\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val errorMessage: String? = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @SerialName(\"data\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val payload: List&#x3C;Item> = emptyList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"transient\">@Transient</h3><p>排除字段不参与序列化（必须有默认值）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Serializable&#10;data class Session(&#10;    val token: String,&#10;    val userId: Long,&#10;    @Transient&#10;    val cachedUser: User? = null // 不序列化&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Session(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val token: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val userId: Long,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Transient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cachedUser: User? = null // 不序列化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"required\">@Required</h3><p>标记字段为必须存在：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Serializable&#10;data class Config(&#10;    @Required&#10;    val apiKey: String,     // JSON 中必须包含此字段&#10;    val timeout: Long = 5000 // 可选，有默认值&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Config(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Required</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val apiKey: String,     // JSON 中必须包含此字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val timeout: Long = 5000 // 可选，有默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"多态序列化\">多态序列化</h2><h3 id=\"sealed-class-序列化\">sealed class 序列化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Serializable&#10;sealed class Shape {&#10;    @Serializable&#10;    @SerialName(&quot;circle&quot;)&#10;    data class Circle(val radius: Double) : Shape()&#10;&#10;    @Serializable&#10;    @SerialName(&quot;rectangle&quot;)&#10;    data class Rectangle(val width: Double, val height: Double) : Shape()&#10;}&#10;&#10;val shapes: List&lt;Shape&gt; = listOf(&#10;    Shape.Circle(5.0),&#10;    Shape.Rectangle(3.0, 4.0)&#10;)&#10;&#10;val jsonStr = Json.encodeToString(shapes)&#10;// [{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;circle&quot;,&quot;radius&quot;:5.0},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;rectangle&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3.0,&quot;height&quot;:4.0}]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class Shape {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @SerialName(\"circle\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Circle(val radius: Double) : Shape()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @SerialName(\"rectangle\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Rectangle(val width: Double, val height: Double) : Shape()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val shapes: List&#x3C;Shape> = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Shape.Circle(5.0),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Shape.Rectangle(3.0, 4.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val jsonStr = Json.encodeToString(shapes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [{\"type\":\"circle\",\"radius\":5.0},{\"type\":\"rectangle\",\"width\":3.0,\"height\":4.0}]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义类型鉴别器\">自定义类型鉴别器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val json = Json {&#10;    classDiscriminator = &quot;_type&quot; // 默认是 &quot;type&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val json = Json {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    classDiscriminator = \"_type\" // 默认是 \"type\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;JSON: {#quot;type#quot;:#quot;circle#quot;, ...}&quot;] --&gt; B{读取 type 字段}&#10;    B --&gt;|circle| C[反序列化为 Circle]&#10;    B --&gt;|rectangle| D[反序列化为 Rectangle]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"JSON: {#quot;type#quot;:#quot;circle#quot;, ...}\"] --&gt; B{读取 type 字段}\n    B --&gt;|circle| C[反序列化为 Circle]\n    B --&gt;|rectangle| D[反序列化为 Rectangle]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义序列化器\">自定义序列化器</h2><h3 id=\"kserializer-接口\">KSerializer 接口</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"object DateAsLongSerializer : KSerializer&lt;Date&gt; {&#10;    override val descriptor = PrimitiveSerialDescriptor(&quot;Date&quot;, PrimitiveKind.LONG)&#10;&#10;    override fun serialize(encoder: Encoder, value: Date) {&#10;        encoder.encodeLong(value.time)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun deserialize(decoder: Decoder): Date {&#10;        return Date(decoder.decodeLong())&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class Event(&#10;    val name: String,&#10;    @Serializable(with = DateAsLongSerializer::class)&#10;    val timestamp: Date&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>object DateAsLongSerializer : KSerializer&#x3C;Date> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override val descriptor = PrimitiveSerialDescriptor(\"Date\", PrimitiveKind.LONG)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun serialize(encoder: Encoder, value: Date) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        encoder.encodeLong(value.time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun deserialize(decoder: Decoder): Date {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Date(decoder.decodeLong())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Event(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Serializable(with = DateAsLongSerializer::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val timestamp: Date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"全局注册序列化器\">全局注册序列化器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val module = SerializersModule {&#10;    contextual(Date::class, DateAsLongSerializer)&#10;}&#10;&#10;val json = Json {&#10;    serializersModule = module&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val module = SerializersModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contextual(Date::class, DateAsLongSerializer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val json = Json {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    serializersModule = module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"多格式支持\">多格式支持</h2><p>kotlinx.serialization 不仅支持 JSON，还支持多种格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Protobuf&#10;dependencies {&#10;    implementation(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-protobuf:1.6.0&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class Message(&#10;    @ProtoNumber(1) val id: Int,&#10;    @ProtoNumber(2) val text: String&#10;)&#10;&#10;val bytes = ProtoBuf.encodeToByteArray(Message(1, &quot;hello&quot;))&#10;val msg = ProtoBuf.decodeFromByteArray&lt;Message&gt;(bytes)&#10;&#10;// CBOR&#10;dependencies {&#10;    implementation(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-cbor:1.6.0&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;val cborBytes = Cbor.encodeToByteArray(user)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Protobuf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-protobuf:1.6.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Message(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ProtoNumber(1) val id: Int,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ProtoNumber(2) val text: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val bytes = ProtoBuf.encodeToByteArray(Message(1, \"hello\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val msg = ProtoBuf.decodeFromByteArray&#x3C;Message>(bytes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// CBOR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-cbor:1.6.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val cborBytes = Cbor.encodeToByteArray(user)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>依赖模块</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td><code>serialization-json</code></td>\n<td>文本格式，人类可读</td>\n<td>REST API、配置文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Protobuf</td>\n<td><code>serialization-protobuf</code></td>\n<td>二进制，高效</td>\n<td>gRPC、微服务通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CBOR</td>\n<td><code>serialization-cbor</code></td>\n<td>二进制 JSON</td>\n<td>IoT、嵌入式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Properties</td>\n<td><code>serialization-properties</code></td>\n<td>扁平键值对</td>\n<td>配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"从-gson-moshi-迁移\">从 Gson/Moshi 迁移</h2><h3 id=\"与-gson-对比\">与 Gson 对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Gson</th>\n<th>kotlinx.serialization</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码生成</td>\n<td>运行时反射</td>\n<td>编译时插件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>更快（无反射）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KMP 支持</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空安全</td>\n<td>❌ 可能为 null</td>\n<td>✅ 编译时检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认值</td>\n<td>忽略</td>\n<td>正确处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"迁移示例\">迁移示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Gson 方式&#10;val gson = Gson()&#10;val user = gson.fromJson(jsonStr, User::class.java) // 运行时反射&#10;&#10;// kotlinx.serialization 方式&#10;val user = Json.decodeFromString&lt;User&gt;(jsonStr) // 编译时生成\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Gson 方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val gson = Gson()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val user = gson.fromJson(jsonStr, User::class.java) // 运行时反射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// kotlinx.serialization 方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val user = Json.decodeFromString&#x3C;User>(jsonStr) // 编译时生成</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"与-moshi-对比\">与 Moshi 对比</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Moshi (with codegen)&#10;@JsonClass(generateAdapter = true)&#10;data class User(&#10;    @Json(name = &quot;user_name&quot;) val name: String&#10;)&#10;&#10;// kotlinx.serialization&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class User(&#10;    @SerialName(&quot;user_name&quot;) val name: String&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Moshi (with codegen)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@JsonClass(generateAdapter = true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class User(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Json(name = \"user_name\") val name: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// kotlinx.serialization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class User(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @SerialName(\"user_name\") val name: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果项目已使用 Gson/Moshi 且不需要 KMP 支持，迁移并非必须。但新项目推荐直接使用 kotlinx.serialization。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能最佳实践\">性能最佳实践</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// ✅ 复用 Json 实例&#10;val AppJson = Json {&#10;    ignoreUnknownKeys = true&#10;    encodeDefaults = false&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ❌ 避免每次创建新实例&#10;fun parse(str: String): User {&#10;    val json = Json { ignoreUnknownKeys = true } // 每次创建，浪费资源&#10;    return json.decodeFromString(str)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 使用 decodeFromStream（大文件）&#10;val user = AppJson.decodeFromStream&lt;User&gt;(inputStream)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 复用 Json 实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val AppJson = Json {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ignoreUnknownKeys = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    encodeDefaults = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 避免每次创建新实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun parse(str: String): User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val json = Json { ignoreUnknownKeys = true } // 每次创建，浪费资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return json.decodeFromString(str)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 使用 decodeFromStream（大文件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val user = AppJson.decodeFromStream&#x3C;User>(inputStream)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>kotlinx.serialization</strong> 是 Kotlin 官方多平台序列化框架，通过编译器插件生成代码</li>\n<li>使用 <strong>@Serializable</strong> 标注数据类，支持 @SerialName、@Transient、@Required 等注解</li>\n<li><strong>Json 配置</strong>通过 builder 模式自定义解析行为（ignoreUnknownKeys、encodeDefaults 等）</li>\n<li><strong>多态序列化</strong>通过 sealed class + @SerialName 实现类型鉴别</li>\n<li>支持 <strong>JSON、Protobuf、CBOR</strong> 等多种格式</li>\n<li>相比 Gson（反射）和 Moshi，kotlinx.serialization 更快、空安全、支持 KMP</li>\n<li>性能优化：复用 Json 实例、大文件使用流式 API</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"序列化","id":"序列化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基础用法","id":"基础用法"},{"level":2,"text":"Json 配置","id":"json-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"注解","id":"注解"},{"level":3,"text":"@SerialName","id":"serialname"},{"level":3,"text":"@Transient","id":"transient"},{"level":3,"text":"@Required","id":"required"},{"level":2,"text":"多态序列化","id":"多态序列化"},{"level":3,"text":"sealed class 序列化","id":"sealed-class-序列化"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义类型鉴别器","id":"自定义类型鉴别器"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义序列化器","id":"自定义序列化器"},{"level":3,"text":"KSerializer 接口","id":"kserializer-接口"},{"level":3,"text":"全局注册序列化器","id":"全局注册序列化器"},{"level":2,"text":"多格式支持","id":"多格式支持"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Gson/Moshi 迁移","id":"从-gson-moshi-迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"与 Gson 对比","id":"与-gson-对比"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移示例","id":"迁移示例"},{"level":3,"text":"与 Moshi 对比","id":"与-moshi-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"性能最佳实践","id":"性能最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"集合操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/idioms-and-best-practices/collection-operations"},"next":{"title":"测试惯用法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/idioms-and-best-practices/testing-idioms"}}